{"text": "Never leave your father alone when he gets older, even if he does not tell you, even if he still looks strong.\n\nMany fathers never learned how to ask for company. They learned to solve things quietly, to carry the weight and say nothing. So when they age, they do not say I need you. They only grow quieter. They ask you fewer questions. They live with a loneliness they will never show you.\n\nThat man carried you. He corrected you. He stood between you and the world when you were too small to stand there yourself.\n\nOne day he needs you back. A visit. A phone call. Sitting beside him while he tells you the same story for the fourth time, and letting him finish it.\n\nComment father, and I will send you what to say when you call.\n\nDo not wait until he is gone to learn what he was worth. If you have put it off, it is not because you do not love him. It is because you are living fast, and you believed there was more time. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "l", "e", "a", "v", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "a", "l", "o", "n", "e", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "t", "s", " ", "o", "l", "d", "e", "r", ",", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "i", "f", " ", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "e", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "e", "l", "l", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "i", "f", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "s", " ", "s", "t", "r", "o", "n", "g", ".", "\n", "\n", "M", "a", "n", "y", " ", "f", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", "s", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "l", "e", "a", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "h", "o", "w", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "c", "o", "m", "p", "a", "n", "y", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", "y", " ", "l", "e", "a", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "o", "l", "v", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i